### 401
# @no-cookie-jar
# @no-redirect
POST http://localhost:5199/api/championships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "championshipEdition": "2030-01-01T00:00:00",
  "hostCountry": "Testland",
  "type": 0
}

# Expected: 401 Unauthorized
# Reason: POST /api/championships is protected with [Authorize], so anonymous API writes fail without an MVC redirect.

###

### 201

# @no-cookie-jar
# @no-redirect
POST http://localhost:5199/api/championships
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: .AspNetCore.Identity.Application=PASTE_AUTH_COOKIE_HERE

{
  "championshipEdition": "2030-01-01T00:00:00",
  "hostCountry": "Testland",
  "type": 0
}

# Expected: 201 Created
# Reason: authenticated users are allowed to create championships through the API.
